  "created": "2018-01-02T21:51:04.791Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Many of Mecanim's core features as a state machine animator are severely hampered due to those states not being synchronized across clients. It is not uncommon for state machines to become desynchronized across clients due to network conditions or one player joining after the state transition occurred.\n\nUnity appears to provide the NetworkAnimator component which allows you to select which animation parameters to send to other clients. This seems like it would be a sufficient solution for synchronizing states if it could work with VRChat's existing network architecture.\n\n[AvatarOverhaul]",
